1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,960
Where was the Statue of Liberty made?
自由女神像是哪里制造的？

2
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:15,710
Where was the Statue of Liberty made?
自由女神像是哪里制造的？

3
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:23,710
One of the most famous monuments in the world, the Statue of Liberty,
世界上最著名的纪念碑之一——自由女神像，

4
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:31,380
was presented to the USA in the nineteenth century by the people of France.
是19世纪时由法国人民赠送给美国的。

5
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:33,990
The great statue,
这座巨大的雕像

6
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:42,320
which was designed by the sculptor Auguste Bartholdi, took ten years to complete.
由雕塑家奥古斯特·巴托尔迪设计，花了十年才完成。

7
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:55,190
The actual figure was made of copper supported by a metal framework which had been especially constructed by Eiffel.
雕像本身是铜制的，由埃菲尔特制的一个金属框架支撑着。

8
00:00:55,430 --> 00:00:59,880
Before it could be transported to the United States,
在把它运往美国之前，

9
00:01:00,510 --> 00:01:05,520
a site had to be found for it and a pedestal had to be built.
必须先选定一个地点，并建好一个底座。

10
00:01:07,140 --> 00:01:12,490
The site chosen was an island at the entrance of New York Harbour.
选中的地点是纽约港入口处的一个岛。

11
00:01:13,420 --> 00:01:22,550
By 1884, a statue which was 151 feet tall had been erected in Paris.
到1884年，一座高151英尺的雕像已在巴黎竖起。

12
00:01:23,460 --> 00:01:28,710
The following year, it was taken to pieces and sent to America.
第二年，它被拆成小块运往美国。

13
00:01:30,310 --> 00:01:33,160
By the end of October 1886,
到1886年10月底，

14
00:01:33,180 --> 00:01:41,020
the statue had been put together again and it was officially presented to American people by Bartholdi.
雕像重新组装起来，由巴托尔迪正式赠送给美国人民。

15
00:01:42,470 --> 00:01:47,400
Ever since then, the great monument has been a symbol of liberty
从那时起，这座巨大的纪念碑一直是自由的象征，

16
00:01:47,420 --> 00:01:53,360
for the millions of people who have passed through New York Harbour to make their homes in America.
对于途经纽约港到美国安家落户的数百万人来说。
